    <briefdescription>
<para>Indicates either that a local Client Characteristic Configuration descriptor was changed by the remote GATT client, or that a confirmation from the remote GATT client was received upon a successful reception of the indication. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A confirmation by the remote GATT client should be received within 30 seconds after an indication was sent with the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__gatt__server_1gabbea29a7fcf973421c4e8e8b64f8ccbe" kindref="member">sl_bt_gatt_server_send_indication</ref> command, otherwise further GATT transactions over this connection are not allowed by the stack. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
